name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q1_2026'

question 'You open a recipe app and tap the bookmark icon. The icon fills in and a small "Saved!" message slides up. What is the app actually doing in that moment?'

right 'JavaScript detected the tap, updated a variable, and changed what the page displays.'
wrong 'The bookmark icon was already saved — tapping just shows it.'
wrong 'The app reloads the entire page so the new state can appear.'
wrong 'The app sends the bookmark to the server and waits for a reply before showing anything.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

